{"schema_version": 1, "segment_epoch": 1791631080, "covers_from": "2026-10-10T11:18:00+00:00", "covers_to": "2026-10-10T11:19:00+00:00", "next_epoch": 1791631140, "schedule": [{"starts_at": "2026-10-10T11:18:00+00:00", "duration_seconds": 12, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 24964, "sprite_key": "squirrel_oldtown", "district": "zhongzheng", "topic": "交通", "content": "台北車站（忠孝）往東那邊，明明是同一個站名卻在不同路口，好幾次因為這樣錯過公車", "display_name": "中正代表 No.24,964", "mood": "angry", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-10T11:18:12+00:00", "duration_seconds": 15, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 3070, "sprite_key": "penguin_culture", "district": "songshan", "topic": "教育", "content": "我親愛的市長，現在的孩子念書辛苦，地方媽媽只希望孩子在學校，能吃飽吃好，而不是白飯配肉鬆，剩一堆廚餘", "display_name": "松山代表 Rachel", "mood": "positive", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-10T11:18:27+00:00", "duration_seconds": 15, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 38322, "sprite_key": "squirrel_suburb", "district": "shilin", "topic": "交通", "content": "開車族禮讓行人是應該的！但是，\n綠燈右轉常常為了禮讓行人過馬路，車子卡在路口，進退兩難。號誌應該調整", "display_name": "士林代表 No.38,322", "mood": "helpless", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-10T11:18:42+00:00", "duration_seconds": 18, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 45253, "sprite_key": "squirrel_business", "district": "neihu", "topic": "交通", "content": "公車站牌太密集頻繁停靠，是內湖路塞車其中一個原因。請減少站牌，刪除最內側禁行機車，取締危險變換車道。", "display_name": "內湖代表 No.45,253", "mood": "worried", "is_replay": true}], "queue": [{"position": 1, "queue_number": 3070, "sprite_key": "penguin_culture", "display_name": "松山代表 Rachel", "district": "songshan", "is_replay": true, "frozen": true}, {"position": 2, "queue_number": 38322, "sprite_key": "squirrel_suburb", "display_name": "士林代表 No.38,322", "district": "shilin", "is_replay": true, "frozen": true}, {"position": 3, "queue_number": 45253, "sprite_key": "squirrel_business", "display_name": "內湖代表 No.45,253", "district": "neihu", "is_replay": true, "frozen": true}, {"position": 4, "queue_number": 60499, "sprite_key": "squirr